      "content": "It's a painful thought, but you're not a cloud of bad luck; you're a flawed person, and flaws are just opportunities for change, even if you can't see it right now. The fact that you want them to be happy is a testament to your love, but that love doesn't require you to self-destruct. Instead of trying to fix the past, focus on the present moment and what small, manageable step you can take to ease the pressure you feel.",
