    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just it... \"small steps\" don't fix the fact that my existence is the problem. i look at them and i just see how much better they smile when i'm not there to mess things up. it feels so selfish to keep dragging them down just because i'm afraid to leave. wouldn't it be more selfless if i just... made it so they didn't have to worry about me anymore? like, if i just removed the source of all their stress?",
